Package: viralGenomeComparator
Type: Package
Title: Educational Viral Genome Comparison Tools
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Gaith", "Korchid", email = "189360939+Gaith2000korchid@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible utilities for learning viral comparative genomics in R,
    including nucleotide sequence quality control, transparent global pairwise
    alignment with Needleman-Wunsch, alignment-derived similarity metrics,
    site-level conservation summaries, and cluster-agreement statistics.
